      "stem_html": "<p>Þíamín, eða B<sub>1</sub>-vítamín, inniheldur jákvætt hlaðinn fimm liða nitur-brennisteins-hringliðu sem kallast <i>þíasólíum</i>hringur. Útskýrðu hvers vegna þíasólíumhringurinn er arómatískur.</p>\n<img class=\"scaled-down\" src=\"https://exercises.openstax.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/proxy/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBaU1WIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--041df881d7e06174946707272fbdf3616e58e546/OChem_15_05_007.jpg\" alt=\"Vitamin B 1 contains a thiazolium ring in which C 2 is bonded to 2-carbon chain with terminal carbon bonded to hydroxyl group. N 3 of the ring is bonded to a C H 2 whch in turn is bonded to a 6-membered substituted ring.\">",
